    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">The Control And Provisioning of Wireless Access Points Protocol
allows a Wireless Termination Point to use DHCP to discover the
Access Controllers to which it is to connect.  This document
describes the DHCP options to be used by the CAPWAP Protocol.</t>
    </abstract>
